  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Per the release notes, ( https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202342p2m ), VRChat on Android is supposed to prompt to merge accounts with a VRChat.com account on first log-in using Google. However, **this currently does not seem to work**, and **the option to upgrade your account, present with Steam, Oculus/Meta, Pico, and other accounts, is missing.**\n\nThis leaves Google accounts in a perpetual state of being \"lesser\" accounts, and removes the ability to speed up login using Google with VRChat.com accounts proper.\n\n(Bug filed on behalf of a friend. We went through troubleshooting and testing to confirm this was not a fluke, using other Google accounts.)\n\nIssue occurred with latest build available on the Play Store as of March 13th, 2024, 6:00 PM Central.",
